Modifications (project-local, WIMS-BFP):
  - Loopback-only network enforcement (localhost, *.localhost, 127.0.0.0/8,
    ::1) for navigation, popups, redirects, subresources, fetch/XHR, and
    WebSockets; credentials in URLs are rejected.
  - Removed: arbitrary page JavaScript evaluation, arbitrary external
    browsing, storage-state import, live-browser CDP attachment, video
    recording, run-summary bundling, tab management tools, and slash
    commands.
  - Added: explicit browser_start (fresh headless Chromium run), browser_select,
    browser_trace_start / browser_trace_stop (Playwright tracing), blocked-
    request evidence in browser_network, and deterministic whole-run close.
  - TypeScript declarations target the installed
    `@earendil-works/pi-coding-agent` API (0.84.1) instead of the upstream
    `@mariozechner` package name.

